,ytd-masthead.theater svg#yt-logo-red-svg #youtube-red-paths path,ytd-masthead.theater svg#yt-logo-svg #youtube-paths path{fill:#fff}</style><style class="searchbox" nonce="juCRPNFfj2krrtHp6wLdjg">#search-input.ytd-searchbox-spt input{-webkit-appearance:none;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;background-color:transparent;border:none;box-shadow:none;color:inherit;font-family:Roboto,Noto,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;line-height:24px;margin-left:4px;max-width:100%;outline:none;text-align:inherit;width:100%;-ms-flex:1 1 0.000000001px;-webkit-flex:1;-webkit-box-flex:1;-moz-box-flex:1;flex:1;-webkit-flex-basis:0.000000001px;-ms-flex-preferred-size:0.000000001px;flex-basis:0.000000001px}#search-container.ytd-searchbox-spt{pointer-events:none;position:absolute;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0}#search-input.ytd-searchbox-spt #search::-webkit-input-placeholder{color:#888}#search-input.ytd-searchbox-spt #search::-moz-input-placeholder{color:#888}#search-input.ytd-searchbox-spt #search:-ms-input-placeholder{color:#888}</style><style class="kevlar_global_styles" nonce="juCRPNFfj2krrtHp6wLdjg">html{background-color:#fff!important;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none}html[dark]{background-color:#0f0f0f!important}#logo-red-icon-container.ytd-topbar-logo-renderer{width:86px}</style><meta name="theme-color" content="rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98)"><link rel="search" type="application/opensearchdescription+xml" href="https://www.youtube.com/opensearch?locale=en_US" title="YouTube"><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest" crossorigin="use-credentials"><script type="application/ld+json" nonce="IQ7p7gz-DVcyazSusXqk0w">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"VideoObject","@id":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v\u003dYjLS_SJezrc","name":"MBEUMO BENCHED 😲 REVIEWING YOUR FPL GW1 PLAYERS! | Fantasy Premier League 2026/27","thumbnailUrl":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YjLS_SJezrc/maxresdefault.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-08-16T01:30:01-07:00","comment":[{"@type":"https://schema.org/Comment","dateCreated":"2026-08-16T02:26:44-07:00","text":"Thx Harry, Schade is such a good shout!  I was at the Gtech yesterday, checking out Sangare, Ajer and Thiago.  Schade is sharp and certainly ahead of Anthony right now (cant believe I actually forgotten him; something to seriously consider in my no Haaland BB1 draft, especially he has great fixture in my potential weakest GW3, and more affordable than Thiago, since I already have Isak - my GW3 captain, and Pedro must have for GW4).  I try not to be biased but as the Bees supporter I plan to attend more games this season, coz we finally feel like a proper UEFA level side now.  Sangare is more box-to-box than defensive midfielder, and has this classy touch/control like Toney/Wissa, and already in a position to one touch pass or dribble before he receive the ball -  think he will proved to be the difference in our midfield when there would be less time and space in the actual competitive games (his attacking threat on open play + defcon should outscore Gross\u0027s occasional set-piece with minutes risk)","author":{"@type":"https://schema.org/Person","name":"@repentmaster2842","url":"https://www.youtube.com/@repentmaster2842","alternateName":"Repent Master"},"upvoteCount":25}]}</script><script nonce="IQ7p7gz-DVcyazSusXqk0w">if (window.ytcsi) {window.ytcsi.tick('bc', null, '');}var ytimg={count:0,preload:function(src){var img=new Image;var count=++ytimg.count;ytimg[count]=img;img.onload=img.onerror=function(){delete ytimg[count]};img.src=src}};
