ials! https://linktr.ee/FPL_Harry\n💻 Sign Up to Channel Membership for Extra Benefits!  -    / @fplharry  \n___________\nCONTACT ME\n📧  For inquiries of partnerships or sponsorships - please email Harry.Daniels@EngagePartnerships.uk\n🙋🏻‍♂️ Personal Emails - fpl.harry@gmail.com\n___________\n⏱️ Timestamps\n0:00 Intro\n0:31 Brentford Attack\n3:05 Mbeumo Benched\n4:21 Tzolis\n5:47 Gibbs-White\n7:23 Muharemovic\n8:45 Simms £5.0m\n10:16 Egeli £4.5m\n11:24 Sarr\n12:50 Tarkowski\n14:14 Wissa\n15:27 Hume £4.5m DEF\n16:56 Kluivert\n18:14 Aston Villa\n20:06 Palestra\n21:39 Rogers\n25:20 Outro\n___________\n\n#fpl   #fantasypremierleague   #premierleague  #gw1","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":46,"length":27,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CKsCEM2rARgBIhMIqf-K2vOrlgMVD8rSBB2jHw3WSLed-5LS37SZYsoBBFwAzMk=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rU3NSM3NiWXJTaWMxZUpoR25NVFlZWXxBR3JiS2FuMWRKZjFNRHA2QjFxNUNoNGtoQldaT29VZkwtc0d2TVB5TE1mR1ZUUmZtMlZHVVZlckdMQW5uTnR6dFVyWFNlbmhNekJQMGgxZ0JjdEpKRnVMRzdrYzB2Wnc1YU01\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFScoutHarry\u0026v=YjLS_SJezrc","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rU3NSM3NiWXJTaWMxZUpoR25NVFlZWXxBR3JiS2FuMWRKZjFNRHA2QjFxNUNoNGtoQldaT29VZkwtc0d2TVB5TE1mR1ZUUmZtMlZHVVZlckdMQW5uTnR6dFVyWFNlbmhNekJQMGgxZ0JjdEpKRnVMRzdrYzB2Wnc1YU01\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFScoutHarry\u0026v=YjLS_SJezrc","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":237,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CKsCEM2rARgBIhMIqf-K2vOrlgMVD8rSBB2jHw3WSLed-5LS37SZYsoBBFwAzMk=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUW80WWlNSktSaDV2b29DcC02Yi1XZHxBR3JiS2FuNEdFOXhuZWtJSGVScm9KbVZBaHlBdExaYmdyVEVCYWZ6ZkJpanZ3Q0F6SWJuckg1S0h